00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
You know, when you stop and look at it, one film in Pixar's catalogue

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.640
truly shows us the dangers of the rampant consumerism in today's culture.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:12.560
It's a statement on the human desire to accumulate more and more and more useless stuff

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.700
that just becomes garbage, meaningless trash that eventually cycles back to becoming meaningless trash.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.000
And that movie is--

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.140
[playing advertisements] Ka-chow!! Thunder Hollow challenge — quick fix

