00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:56.340
they needed to find a way to force people off of the planet,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:01.240
and what better way than to turn every city into a huge contamination zone.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:04.540
And not only did they have the motive, they have the means to do it.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.239
They're the largest seller of goods in the Pixar forest

00:11:07.239 --> 00:11:12.849
So, they could very easily create less efficient products. Then, they would throttle the sanitation supply.

00:11:12.849 --> 00:11:14.460
I mean, you see it in Up.

