Because what's better than saving a couple bucks by being green?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:28.760
Well, stealing everyone's lifetime income by keeping them captive on your space cruiser.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:32.820
In Wall-E, we see the world reduced to a desolate wasteland and all this time

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:36.240
we've been led to believe that this was something that happened because of us.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:41.820
Because humanity was careless and wasteful and didn't look after the environment, but the truth is far more sinister.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:46.120
It was Buy n Large - corporate greed that caused this to happen.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:50.860
This, without a doubt, solidifies Buy n Large as the most sinister Pixar villain of all time.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:56.080
I mean, sure, Syndrome killed a few people, but Buy n Large killed an entire planet.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:00.340
